      "label": "BENCHMARKS (2 families) × SITES (6) — paper §7 cross-benchmark generalization"
    },
    {
      "id": "bench_vwaaaaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## VWA — VisualWebArena (visual-rich)\n*image-heavy real web tasks, 67% visual subset (manual audit)*\n\n| Site | N tasks | Domain |\n|---|---:|---|\n| **classifieds** | 234 | Craigslist-like classifieds (vehicle / job posts) |\n| **reddit** | 210 | Reddit forum (subscribe / comment / search) |\n| **shopping** | 466 | Magento e-commerce (cart / checkout / catalog) |\n\n**Site total**: 910 tasks · **non-visual subset**: ~33%"
    },
    {
      "id": "bench_waaaaaaaaaa1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1580,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 1620,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## WA — WebArena (text-dominated)\n*image-light task suite, 100% non-visual (benchmark field 贯穿全链路)*\n\n| Site | N tasks | Domain |\n|---|---:|---|\n| **shopping** | 192 | Magento (e-commerce baseline) |\n| **shopping_admin** | 182 | Magento admin panel (admin/admin1234) |\n| **reddit** | 106 | Reddit forum |\n\n**Site total**: 480 tasks · cross-bench reset mechanism 暂未实现 (issue backlog)"
    }
  ],
